        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190589?u=f533e20910aae6e8ef669d6ccf02c94d3ca93d5c&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h4 dir="auto">Summary</h4>
<p dir="auto">Adds <code class="notranslate">webextensions.api.runtime.MessageSender.windowId</code>. Firefox 160 supports it. Safari has it in WebKit (not in a released build yet), so the entry is <code class="notranslate">false</code> with the WebKit bug. Chrome is tracked in <a href="https://crbug.com/579968332" rel="nofollow">https://crbug.com/579968332</a>.</p>
