<p dir="auto"><code class="notranslate">npm run lint -- webextensions</code> and Prettier pass.</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Firefox: <a class="commit-link" data-hovercard-type="commit" data-hovercard-url="https://github.com/mozilla-firefox/firefox/commit/f43deb1ab6b2/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mozilla-firefox/firefox/commit/f43deb1ab6b2">mozilla-firefox/firefox@<tt>f43deb1ab6b2</tt></a> (Bug <a class="commit-link" data-hovercard-type="commit" data-hovercard-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/commit/2072133d14b79eed448f4f1e50e64eb42689e3d4/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/commit/2072133d14b79eed448f4f1e50e64eb42689e3d4"><tt>2072133</tt></a>, landed 2026-10-16)</li>
