<li>Proposal: <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5360665662" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/w3c/webextensions/issues/1077" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/w3c/webextensions/issues/1077/hovercard" href="https://github.com/w3c/webextensions/issues/1077">w3c/webextensions#1077</a></li>
