    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Add extensionTypes.IconVariant and pageAction.setIcon variants, and the Firefox bug for the icon variants APIs.]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/31072</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/31072"/>
        <updated>2026-11-08T16:25:30.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190589?u=f533e20910aae6e8ef669d6ccf02c94d3ca93d5c&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h4 dir="auto">Summary</h4>
<p dir="auto">Adds <code class="notranslate">extensionTypes.IconVariant</code> and the <code class="notranslate">variants</code> parameter of <code class="notranslate">pageAction.setIcon()</code>, records the <code class="notranslate">any</code> and <code class="notranslate">colorSchemes</code> properties, and adds the Firefox and Chrome bugs for the icon variants APIs.</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><code class="notranslate">extensionTypes.IconVariant</code>: Safari 18.2. It is a dictionary type, so like <code class="notranslate">ImageDetails</code> it describes the structure the APIs accept, and no browser exposes it on the <code class="notranslate">extensionTypes</code> object.</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">extensionTypes.IconVariant.any</code> and <code class="notranslate">icon_variants.any</code>: Safari 18.2, partial, because Safari prefers <code class="notranslate">any</code> over every explicit size in a group instead of using it only when no other size is large enough: <a href="https://webkit.org/b/330501" rel="nofollow">https://webkit.org/b/330501</a>.</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">extensionTypes.IconVariant.colorSchemes</code>: Safari 26.2, with <code class="notranslate">color_schemes</code> as the alternative name from Safari 18.2.</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">icon_variants.color_schemes</code> in the manifest: Safari 18.2.</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">pageAction.setIcon()</code> <code class="notranslate">variants</code>: Safari 18.2. Safari maps <code class="notranslate">pageAction</code> onto the same implementation as <code class="notranslate">action</code>.</li>
<li><a href="https://bugzil.la/1955199" rel="nofollow">https://bugzil.la/1955199</a> is the Firefox <code class="notranslate">impl_url</code> for the type and for the <code class="notranslate">variants</code> and <code class="notranslate">iconVariants</code> parameters of <code class="notranslate">action.setIcon()</code>, <code class="notranslate">browserAction.setIcon()</code>, <code class="notranslate">pageAction.setIcon()</code>, <code class="notranslate">menus.create()</code> and <code class="notranslate">menus.update()</code>.</li>
<li><a href="https://crbug.com/41419485" rel="nofollow">https://crbug.com/41419485</a> is the Chrome <code class="notranslate">impl_url</code> for the type and for <code class="notranslate">action.setIcon()</code>.</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">The <code class="notranslate">mdn_url</code> for the new type is left out until the MDN page exists.</p>
<h4 dir="auto">Test results and supporting details</h4>
<p dir="auto"><code class="notranslate">npm run lint -- webextensions</code> passes.</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6174195138" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/46364" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/pull/46364/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/46364">mdn/content#46364</a></li>
<li><a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3902842338" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/w3c/webextensions/issues/949" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/w3c/webextensions/issues/949/hovercard" href="https://github.com/w3c/webextensions/issues/949">w3c/webextensions#949</a></li>
</ul>
<h4 dir="auto">Related issues</h4>
<p dir="auto">Follows <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6174128428" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/31029" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/31029/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/31029">#31029</a> and <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6228958267" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/31065" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/31065/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/31065">#31065</a>.</p>]]></content>
